                "title": "Everly Handleset with Lewiston Knob",
                "description": "The Everly Handleset with Lewiston Knob is a traditional entry set with strong roots in American Colonial Architecture. The Everly Entry Door Handleset with Lewiston Knob will fit many pre-drilled doors that are a standard thickness from 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches with 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. Choose from stunningly beautiful traditional finish colors.",
